message: "Research software under development. Manuscript citation and author order have not been assigned."
type: software
title: "RCH-PFN: Relation-conditioned history inference from visual interaction contexts"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A configurable research implementation of visual relation contexts, shared
  two-pass hypothesis-conditioned history inference, joint scene distributions,
  action outcome prediction, and validated data/control interfaces.
